Smallest service flow (Java-style pseudocode; `findIdBySku` is your ordinary Jimmer query):

```java
var result = sqlClient.saveCommand(input)
    .setMode(SaveMode.INSERT_IF_ABSENT)
    .execute();

if (result.isAccepted()) {
    return result.getModifiedEntity().id();
}

var existingId = findIdBySku(input.sku());
if (existingId != null) {
    return existingId;
}

throw new RetryableCatalogRaceException(); // Application-defined
```

